#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of cURL"
msgstr "Instalação do cURL"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "First, resolve a problem with a security fix:"
msgstr "Primeiro, resolva um problema com uma correção de segurança:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:150
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i 's/2F 5C/%2F %5C/' scripts/wcurl</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i 's/2F 5C/%2F %5C/' scripts/wcurl</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>cURL</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>cURL</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --with-openssl   \\\n"
"            --with-ca-path=/etc/ssl/certs &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --with-openssl   \\\n"
"            --with-ca-path=/etc/ssl/certs &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. One test, <filename>
#. 1477</filename>, is known to fail due to
#.        a missing file in the curl tarball.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run the test suite, issue: <command>make test</command>.  Some tests are "
"flaky, so if some tests have failed it's possible to run a test again with: "
"<command>(cd tests; ./runtests.pl <replaceable>&lt;test "
"ID&gt;</replaceable>)</command> (the ID of failed tests are shown in the "
"<quote><computeroutput>These test cases failed:</computeroutput></quote> "
"message). If you run the tests after the package has been installed, some "
"tests may fail because the man pages were deleted by the 'find' command in "
"the installation instructions below."
msgstr ""
"Para executar a suíte de teste, emita: <command>make test</command>. Alguns "
"testes são instáveis, de forma que, se alguns testes falharem, é possível "
"executar um teste novamente com: <command>(cd tests; ./runtests.pl "
"<replaceable>&lt;ID do teste&gt;</replaceable>)</command> (o ID dos testes "
"falhos é mostrado na mensagem <quote><computeroutput>These test cases "
"failed:</computeroutput></quote>). Se você executar os testes depois que o "
"pacote tiver sido instalado, alguns testes possivelmente falhem porque as "
"páginas de manual foram deletadas pelo comando 'find' nas instruções de "
"instalação abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:460
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:464
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -rf docs/examples/.deps &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find docs \\( -name Makefile\\* -o  \\\n"
"             -name \\*.1       -o  \\\n"
"             -name \\*.3       -o  \\\n"
"             -name CMakeLists.txt \\) -delete &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cp -v -R docs -T /usr/share/doc/curl-&curl-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -rf docs/examples/.deps &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find docs \\( -name Makefile\\* -o  \\\n"
"             -name \\*.1       -o  \\\n"
"             -name \\*.3       -o  \\\n"
"             -name CMakeLists.txt \\) -delete &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cp -v -R docs -T /usr/share/doc/curl-&curl-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:476
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run some simple verification tests on the newly installed "
"<command>curl</command>, issue the following commands: <command>curl "
"--trace-ascii debugdump.txt https://www.example.com/</command> and "
"<command>curl --trace-ascii d.txt --trace-time "
"https://example.com/</command>.  Inspect the locally created trace files "
"<filename>debugdump.txt</filename> and <filename>d.txt</filename>, which "
"contains version information, downloaded files information, etc. One file "
"has the time for each action logged."
msgstr ""
"Para executar alguns testes simples de verificação sobre o recém instalado "
"<command>curl</command>, emita os seguintes comandos: <command>curl --trace-"
"ascii debugdump.txt https://www.example.com/</command> e <command>curl "
"--trace-ascii d.txt --trace-time https://example.com/</command>. Inspecione "
"os arquivos de rastreamento criados localmente "
"<filename>debugdump.txt</filename> e <filename>d.txt</filename>, que contém "
"informações de versão, informações dos arquivos baixados, etc. Um arquivo "
"tem a hora para cada ação registrada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:488
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:494
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-ca-path=/etc/ssl/certs</parameter>: This switch sets the "
"location of the BLFS Certificate Authority store."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-ca-path=/etc/ssl/certs</parameter>: Essa chave define o "
"local do armazenamento da Autoridade Certificadora do BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:499
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-openssl</parameter>: This parameter chooses "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> as SSL/TLS implementation.  This option "
"is not needed if <option>--with-gnutls</option> is selected instead."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-openssl</parameter>: Esse parâmetro escolhe "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> como implementação SSL/TLS. Essa opção "
"não é necessária se <option>--with-gnutls</option> for selecionada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:506
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-gssapi</option>: This parameter adds <application>Kerberos "
"5</application> support to <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libcurl</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-gssapi</option>: Esse parâmetro adiciona suporte "
"&quot;<application>Kerberos 5</application>&quot; à &quot;<filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libcurl</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:512
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-gnutls</option>: Use this switch to build with "
"<application>GnuTLS</application> support instead of "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> for SSL/TLS."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-gnutls</option>: Use essa chave para construir com suporte "
"<application>GnuTLS</application> em vez de "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> para SSL/TLS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:518
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-ca-bundle=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt</option>: Use this"
" switch instead of <parameter>--with-ca-path</parameter> if building with "
"<application>GnuTLS</application> support instead of "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> for SSL/TLS."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-ca-bundle=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt</option>: Use essa"
" chave em vez de &quot;<parameter>--with-ca-path</parameter>&quot; se "
"construir com suporte &quot;<application>GnuTLS</application>&quot; em vez "
"de &quot;<application>OpenSSL</application>&quot; para "
"&quot;SSL&quot;/&quot;TLS&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:525
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-libssh2</option>: This parameter adds "
"<application>SSH</application> support to cURL. This is disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-libssh2</option>: Esse parâmetro adiciona suporte "
"&quot;<application>SSH</application>&quot; ao &quot;cURL&quot;. Isso é "
"desabilitado por padrão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:531
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-ares</option>: This parameter adds support for DNS "
"resolution through the c-ares library."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-ares</option>: Esse parâmetro adiciona suporte para "
"resolução DNS por meio da biblioteca c-ares."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/curl.xml:536
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>find docs ... -exec rm {} \\;</command>: This command removes "
"<filename>Makefiles</filename> and man files from the documentation "
"directory that would otherwise be installed by the commands that follow."
msgstr ""
"<command>find docs ... -exec rm {} \\;</command>: Esse comando remove "
"&quot;<filename>Makefiles</filename>&quot; e arquivos de manual do diretório"
" de documentação que de outra forma seriam instalados pelos comandos a "
"seguir."

